ment_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120531010:1":{"text":"These waterbirds are originally from the Remnant Peaks, where the environment is mild and humid, completely different from the hot and dry Eroded Enclave.","source_cn":"这些水鸟的原生地在遗迹群山，那里的环境温和潮湿，和酷热...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD90EF95C4B463C22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120531011:1":{"text":"Unlike hornleaf bears, they have poor adaptability, and enduring the journey here likely strained their bodies.","source_cn":"它们和叶角熊不一样，适应力很差，一路颠簸来到这里，估计...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7BF5359D68BF4B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120531012:1":{"text":"No, they can't stay here! They'll suffer even more than Patto!","source_cn":"……不，它们不能留在这里！会比帕托更可怜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF4A41FE7C627A96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120531013:1":{"text":"Can you take them back where they belong?","source_cn":"你们知道它们原来在哪里？拜托，送它们回家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA726D03C2D085163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120531014:0":{"text":"*Groan*","source_cn":"呜嗷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0ABE0B88D16740C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_m